<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Renew my mind, oh Lord, day by day dispense Your life;</l><l>My wandering thoughts purify completely;</l><l>Replace my will, oh Lord, with Your will that I would say</l><l>“Oh Lord, Amen,” always trusting You, following You.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Increase my love for You so that I would love You,</l><l>Return Your love with Yours, responding to Your call;</l><l>Reveal more of Yourself to me so I can see</l><l>Your divine economy, shine on me Your speaking.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
